じゃあどうすんの？
So what are you going to do?

218
00:26:05,254 --> 00:26:08,094
それでいいんだって
That's fine, they say

219
00:26:08,194 --> 00:26:12,054
頭はからまわり死んでいく
My head is spinning in circles, dying away

